lic\\\">Let's go out for dinner!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd like that!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about a movie!</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">OK, sounds good. </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Family"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about family, you often describe their personal qualities.   You can talk about their  behavior and their personalities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Behavior is the way a person  acts or conducts themselves. <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Tom is usually relaxed, but today he seems nervous.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Personality is a person's  general character (they way they are). <br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Sandra is a tidy person. Her apartment is always clean and neat.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We use adjectives to talk about behavior and personality."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Synonym\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"demanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"exacting; tough\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"picky\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fussy; particular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"predictable\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"as expected \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"grouchy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"surly; testy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"tex